    "result": "Perfect! All tests are now passing. Here's a summary of the fixes:\n\n**Issue 1 - Governance test failure**: `APPROVAL_STATUSES` was not exported as a named export. I added named exports for `APPROVAL_STATUSES` and other constants at the top of `finetune/index.js`, while keeping the default export for backward compatibility.\n\n**Issue 2 - Toxicity test failure**: The `toxicityMetric` function had the wrong signature for how it was being called by `runEvaluations`. All metrics are called with `(outputs, references)`, but toxicityMetric expected `(outputs, bannedTerms)`. I updated the signature to `toxicityMetric(outputs, references, bannedTerms = defaultBannedTerms)` so references are properly captured and default banned terms are used.\n\nBoth fixes maintain backward compatibility with existing public exports while ensuring the test suite passes completely.",
